          "review_body": "Hey @UlisesGascon, this addition looks really valuable, having a clear threat model definitely helps contributors understand Lodash’s security scope.\r\nA few small notes are that you could consider linking specific examples or scenarios under each “trust boundary” section in threat-model.md for clarity. Maybe add a brief note in SECURITY.md summarizing what the threat model covers (e.g., “out-of-scope: client-side misuse”) so readers get the gist without opening another file.\r\n",
